# ICLC Lucky Draw Application - Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your actual values

# Application Configuration
PORT=3111
ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin123

# MySQL Database Configuration
# Database Configuration
DB_HOST=103.1.xxx
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=abcacacac
DB_NAME=iclc_edux
DB_PORT=3306

# Notes:
# 1. PORT - The port the application will run on (default: 3111)
# 2. ADMIN_PASSWORD - Password for admin access (default: admin123)
# 3. DB_HOST - MySQL database host (use 'localhost' for local development)
# 4. DB_USER - MySQL database username
# 5. DB_PASSWORD - MySQL database password
# 6. DB_NAME - MySQL database name (should match your database)
# 7. DB_PORT - MySQL database port (default: 3306)

# For production, make sure to:
# - Use strong, unique passwords
# - Set appropriate database connection limits
# - Configure proper security for your database
# - Use environment-specific values (don't commit real credentials)